    "check": "read on the page images: results (BNL 19 Sep 1946 p. 5) print the twelve elected with votes, as entered, but spell 'J. M. Reith', 'J. W. M'Coubrey', 'J. B. Owens' and 'G. C. Ash'; the nominations (BNL 6 Sep 1946 p. 5) print the eighteen as J. M. Wreath, T. W. M'Coubrey, J. P. Owens and G. C. Ashe, with the six defeated: M. Cunningham, R. M'Ilroy, D. M'Kenna, J. Donaghy, A. Getty, T. L. M'Elderry. No votes are printed for the defeated.",
